---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

import '../styles/content.css';

const lastUpdated = 'January 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Donkams collects, uses, and protects your information."
  noIndex={false}
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="text-label page-header__eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="page-header__title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-header__lede">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
           This Privacy Policy explains how Donkams collects, uses, stores and
        protects information when you visit our website, contact us, browse
        our products or interact with our services. We aim to keep our
        practices clear and easy to understand, without unnecessary legal
        jargon.
        </p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you contact us through this website, we collect the information
          you provide: your name, email address, phone number (if given), and
          the message you send. If you reach us on WhatsApp, we receive the
          information you choose to share through that channel.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not use tracking cookies, analytics scripts, or advertising
          pixels on this site. We do not build profiles of visitors.
        </p>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your enquiry</li>
          <li>To help you find the right product or solution</li>
          <li>To follow up on a purchase you've made or are considering</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or share your information with third parties
          for marketing purposes. We do not send unsolicited messages.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Enquiries are kept for as long as needed to resolve them, plus a
          reasonable period afterward in case you return with a related
          question. You can ask us to delete your information at any time.
        </p>

        <h2>Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us what information we hold about you, request a copy,
          or ask us to delete it. Contact us at
          <a href="mailto:donkamscomputer@gmail.com">donkamscomputer@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-party services</h2>
        <p>
          This site links to WhatsApp for messaging. When you use WhatsApp to
          contact us, WhatsApp's own privacy policy applies to that
          conversation. We have no control over how WhatsApp handles your data.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>
          If this policy changes, we'll update the "last updated" date at the
          top of this page. Significant changes will be communicated through
          the contact channels we have on file.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about this policy? Email
          <a href="mailto:donkamscomputer@gmail.com">donkamscomputer@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>